{
  "rationale": "The plant is split into sensing and motion. The specification binds sensor outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforcing conservative recovery only when needed. Recovery states are one-shot and do not chain. Full rotate is only enabled after repeated failures. All transitions are deterministic and respect the event/action constraints.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for perception and motion to allow modular specification.",
    "Specification automata enforce safe, coverage-oriented action selection and conservative, non-repetitive recovery."
